omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6pvwKF7UM-kQ7kNvwGWmGQv&_nc_oc=Adqnh6C1Unx-fyyRaJZNuc9W-MY576jQQCLQhtnUJImwIfpNY9bVAWmcaryBlCo2G5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDtA_GYE0xn9riOZ7MKwLB8EqQlm3oveqDzLnp8_nFe1g&oe=6A6B6C34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V9WCi9DhrGIQ7kNvwE4QwKD&_nc_oc=Adp1T_18T_CjFL01E1yy3X5cMG6VJBIvdhryKneXZRLjMLsdX9fKqDGKWoL4lSOd0cM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAG5Cgwy0U_7xrXDlAaBGOB-ULYGh9WgRghc73oBIvLew&oe=6A6B3556"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cUMSI8eT_NAQ7kNvwFTQTnJ&_nc_oc=Adossbwl6WFbwXqVJ570MPJ2NqOCHATLqUZe0l3KCy9nYUSwT3m_SuUGIYq7souQ-LI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCeIFi7z2AXJYwlH_HlgA2JArIP03qkzojXzajqCYMDoQ&oe=6A6B4A77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://